# Both images are built from the repository root. The backend needs it because
# Backend.csproj pulls Generators/ in as analyzers and ../types.xml in as an
# AdditionalFile. The frontend needs it because its Dockerfile regenerates
# src/lib/ws/dto.generated.ts and src/lib/debug/protocol.generated.ts from
# types.xml via a .NET generator stage before running vite build. This list is
# therefore load-bearing for both: without it the whole working tree is sent to
# the daemon.

.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.vs
.idea
.vscode
.claude
.opencode

# Build output, dependency trees and test artifacts — rebuilt inside the image,
# and host artifacts are the wrong RID or platform. (Frontend/.dockerignore
# used to carry these; the root list now governs the frontend image too.)
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
Frontend/.svelte-kit
Frontend/build
Frontend/test-results
Frontend/playwright-report

# Generated DTO preview output. The frontend image regenerates what it needs
# from types.xml, so a stale local copy must not reach the daemon.
**/*.generated.*

# Local state that must never be baked into an image.
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-journal
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
appsettings.Development.json
**/*.user

# Docs and deployment descriptors contribute nothing to a build.
doc
deploy
*.md